Data
----
data/sources/kenan-tepe/ and the Kenan Tepe records in data/strata.rl are
derived from:

  Bradley Parker and Peter Cobb (eds.), "Kenan Tepe". Released 2012-02-27.
  Open Context. https://doi.org/10.6078/M7H41PBJ
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made: records were fetched through the Open Context API, reduced to
the fields Strata uses, and their stratigraphic statements were merged into
graph relationships (each keeps the record that stated it and its URI).
Taxon identifiers link to GBIF (https://www.gbif.org/).
